    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.43115234375,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is from WHO’s Consolidated guidelines on HIV infection, testing, treatment,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.74658966064453,
        527.3876342773438,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "(42) service delivery and monitoring: recommendations for a public health approach  . The background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.967501640319824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.386962890625,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "and history of this recommendation is provided below, while the detailed rationale and supporting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        293.1805114746094,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "evidence can be found in the source document.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        151.12660217285156,
        527.3839111328125,
        165.56959533691406
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation applies to both children and adults but the strength of the recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        164.3266143798828,
        527.4883422851562,
        178.7696075439453
      ],
      "text": "and certainty of the evidence differ for each group because of the difference in the available data for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999699592590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.52662658691406,
        527.3946533203125,
        191.96961975097656
      ],
      "text": "the reviews. One specific exception that is highlighted in this recommendation relates to situations in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.7266387939453,
        527.4332885742188,
        205.1696319580078
      ],
      "text": "which signs and symptoms of meningitis are present. Caution is needed regarding people who are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.92652893066406,
        527.4278564453125,
        218.36952209472656
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and who have TB meningitis because immediate ART is significantly associated with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.1265411376953,
        527.4310913085938,
        231.5695343017578
      ],
      "text": "more severe adverse events. Thus, it might be a consideration to delay ART for 4–8 weeks after TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.3264923095703,
        247.93203735351562,
        244.7694854736328
      ],
      "text": "treatment is initiated in such situations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.03053283691406,
        514.2785034179688,
        266.4735412597656
      ],
      "text": "The use of corticosteroids as adjuvant treatment for TB meningitis still applies in these situations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.8477478027344,
        137.97488403320312,
        295.6997375488281
      ],
      "text": "Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.9075927734375,
        527.4024047851562,
        317.3506164550781
      ],
      "text": "Since 2010, WHO has recommended that ART be started as soon as possible within eight weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.83172607421875,
        527.41650390625,
        330.5507507324219
      ],
      "text": "(43) of initiating TB treatment (strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence)  . In 2012, WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        329.3076171875,
        527.4697265625,
        343.7506408691406
      ],
      "text": "added a recommendation to initiate ART within two weeks among those with a CD4 count less than or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966147422790527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.5075988769531,
        527.478759765625,
        356.95062255859375
      ],
      "text": "equal to 50 cells/mm  (except for children for whom previous recommendations remained unchanged  3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9653959274292,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.4316101074219,
        527.4246215820312,
        370.150634765625
      ],
      "text": "(11) because of the lack of specific evidence)  . In 2017, on the basis of a systematic review of evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.631591796875,
        527.3875732421875,
        383.3506164550781
      ],
      "text": "(44) that earlier ART initiation resulted in reduced morbidity and mortality  , WHO recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.10760498046875,
        527.4376831054688,
        396.5506286621094
      ],
      "text": "offering rapid ART initiation within one week, and on the same day if ready, for all people diagnosed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.0316162109375,
        527.392822265625,
        409.7506408691406
      ],
      "text": "(44) with HIV – including adults, adolescents and children   – with stated cautions for those with signs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
